      494.88,
      310.16,
      552.95
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of Land depicted as Lot Nos. 01, 02 and 03 inprliminary plan No. G/4220 situated in the village of Goviyapanain No. 156, Ahangama - East Grama Niladhari's Division in theDivisional Secretary's Division of Habaraduwa in Galle DistrictSouthern Province and described as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      563.33,
      310.13,
      611.51
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 1Name of the Land: Oruthotawatta; Description and Claimantof the Land: Open waste land, H. W. M. A. Gunasekara, MataraRoad, Goviyapana, Ahangama; Extent: 0.0007 Hectare.",
