    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      619.49,
      310.13,
      667.43
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 2Name of the Land: Oruthotawatta; Description and Claimantof the Land: Open waste land, H. U. P. Priyantha, Matara Road,Goviyapana, Ahangama; Extent: 0.0046 Hectare.",
