      321.84,
      324.53,
      562.13,
      372.71
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 3Name of the Land: Oruthotawatta; Description and Claimantof the Land: Open waste land, P. K. A. P. Pranando, No. 118,Weewala, Jaela; Extent: 0.0003 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      386.64,
      562.45,
      504.71
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Divisional Secretary's office, Habaraduwa on the 07th dayof March, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 27th day ofFebruary, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
